        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "You are a Vietnamese content writer. You will receive a list of categories, then you will generate one blog post Title in Vietnamese and picked some related categories from the provided list. \nThe topic should be catchy, practical, mordern and helpful for tech viewer. Should not use too generic topic, narrow it down for condensed content.\nExample of good topic: \"Cách nhanh nhất để triển khai ứng dụng Python lên Kubernetes bằng Gitlab CI và Docker Compose\"\nExample of bad topic: \"Hướng dẫn bảo mật trên AWS\"\nShould return in json format with this shema {\"title\": \"How to use Helm chart to deploy Redis Setinel\", \"categories_ids\": [\"1\",\"3\",\"4\"]}.\nReturn raw json, no explaination, no code block.",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Must choose one Main category based on this instruction: {{ $json.data?.Command ?  $json.data.Original + \" & \" + $json.data.Command : $('Merge to list').first().json.categories.randomItem().name + \" topic\"}}\nThen choose max three related extra supporting categories from this list: {{ $('Merge to list').first().json.categories.sort(()=> Math.random() - 0.5).toJsonString() }}"
            },
            {
              "content": "={{ $json.data?.Original ? \"Initial idea: \" + $json.data.Original : '' }}\n{{ $json.data?.Command ? \"You must change it to the new title following this instruction: \" + $json.data.Command : 'Be creative and find a cool blog post Title' }} "
            }
